+- Adds presentation-only synchronized selection treatment for canvas placements, artifact-library entries, and flow cards.
+- Makes placement controls keyboard-operable while continuing to emit the existing typed `DESIGN.COMPOSITION.*` actions.
+- Makes journey mini-layout thumbnails directly activatable while preserving `FLOW.SELECT` as the authoritative state-selection route.
+- Adds semantic region-stack drop targets: dragging a placement to a region emits `DESIGN.COMPOSITION.RELOCATE`; the browser never mutates the project directly.
