+# notNotes Web Wire live boundary
+
+`web/notnotes/preview.html` remains a visual/control checkpoint. It is **not** the live application.
+
+The live path is:
+
+```text
+MiniNotesApp / Alchemy NotNotes authority
+       |
+       | public NotNotes operations / detached projection
+       v
+NotNotesWebProjectionPort
+       |
+       | no DOM, no transport credentials, no Wire revision invention
+       v
+Wire UI application host / Server
+       |
+       | authoritative definitions, snapshots, patches, workspaceContext
+       v
+existing ObjectQueueManager
+       |
+       v
+Queue Fabric Web Gateway v0.2
+       |
+       | WebSocket; opaque delivery ids only
+       v
+Alchemy Wire UI JS browser runtime
+       |
+       v
+modern notNotes Web projection
+```
+
+## Browser
+
+`web/notnotes/live.html` is deliberately only a static access-point shell. `notnotes-wire-live.js` boots the accepted Wire browser runtime classes and sends `UI_HELLO` through the Queue Fabric gateway. It contains no NotNotes business rules, lifecycle decisions, persistence, report execution or intention implementation.
+
+Configuration is deployment data (`moduleUrl`, gateway URL, fixed outbound queue and ownership tuple). Browser identity does not grant authority to choose arbitrary Queue Fabric queues.
+
+## NotNotes adapter
+
+`examples/notnotes/NotNotesWebProjectionPort.cls` is a downstream consumer adapter around the real `MiniNotesApp` public surface. It currently proves:
+
+- live all/view/query projection;
+- bounded windows (maximum 200 rows per projection);
+- stable NotNotes document identity/key;
+- selected-document detail;
+- format/report discovery;
+- select/open;
+- explicit persistence;
+- submit/approve/reject;
+- typed user-format field update;
+- link/unlink document references;
+- saved-report execution.
+
+The adapter intentionally does **not** produce `workspaceContext`, view revisions, result freshness, access decisions, journey authority or intention `READY` state. Those belong to the corresponding Wire Server / application / Intention authorities.
+
+Actions not yet routed by this small port return `HOST_ACTION_REQUIRED`; they are not guessed or silently emulated.
+
+## Qualification
+
+`tests/test_notnotes_live_projection.rex` executes against the actual current Mini NotNotes package when `NOTNOTES_ROOT` is supplied. It proves that a semantic approval goes through the real `MiniNotesApp` and that a fresh projection sees the authoritative state change.
+
+`tests/test_notnotes_live_web_bootstrap.mjs` locks the browser-side negative rules: real Wire runtime/gateway objects must be present, `putResultMode` is required, server-semantic mode is enabled, and no NotNotes lifecycle implementation may leak into the browser bootstrap.
